Q3) More classes we added are:
MiniWorld: Represents a world of the game in a fixed X range.
Its job is to tracks all the GameObject components such as blocks and trees in its x range.
OOP Design Choices :
Encapsulation+Information Hiding: The cleanup is hidden inside MiniWorld.remove().
Single Responsibility Principle: MiniWorld handles local  world cycle management for X range.

